    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41419" root="هوس" body-key="h">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَوَسٌ</span></b>  <i>Somewhat of madness,</i> or <i>insanity,</i> or
<i>diabolical possession,</i> (S, A, K,) <i>in the head:</i>
(A:) or <i>a vertigo,</i> or <i>giddiness, and confused
noise, in the head.</i> (A, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Hence used by
the vulgar to signify <i>Hope.</i> (TA.)

